dtaparser bundles Rust code from this repository (the dta, dta-parquet,
and dta-arrow crates, GPL-3.0-only) and, for reading and writing Parquet
files, these crates from crates.io. The source package carries their
source in src/rust/vendor.tar.xz with each crate's own licence files. A
package built from GitHub fetches the same versions (src/rust/Cargo.lock).

Compiled into the package:

  snap 1.1.2             BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/BurntSushi/rust-snappy
  lz4_flex 0.11.6        MIT            https://github.com/pseitz/lz4_flex
  miniz_oxide 0.8.9      MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0
                                        https://github.com/Frommi/miniz_oxide
  adler2 2.0.1           0BSD OR MIT OR Apache-2.0
                                        https://github.com/oyvindln/adler2
  zstd 0.13.4            BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
  zstd-safe 7.4.0        BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
  zstd-sys 2.1.2         BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
    with Zstandard (libzstd) 1.5.7, by Meta Platforms, Inc. and
    affiliates, BSD-3-Clause (dual-licensed BSD or GPLv2)
                                        https://github.com/facebook/zstd

